fe","owner":"chaitanyakrishna1248","html_url":"https://github.com/chaitanyakrishna1248/Project-Safe","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"A simple project designed during pandemic where residents of my apartment are provided with a passcode with which they can unlock the door of the lift to go their floors. Only the residents of the lift possess the passcode. This prevents strangers or outsiders from entering the elevator to ensure protection of residents from virus.","topics":[],"score":2172,"global_rank":224782},{"name":"chaitanyakrishna1248/Atmospheric-analysis-of-Abandoned-mines-using-rover","owner":"chaitanyakrishna1248","html_url":"https://github.com/chaitanyakrishna1248/Atmospheric-analysis-of-Abandoned-mines-using-rover","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"This project aims to design a LoRa Based Wireless Rover using Arduino Uno & LoRa Module. A DHT Sensor and Gas Sensor to monitor the environment GY-68 sensor along with an Ultrasonic Sensor is used to control the rover. The rover measures the mine environment parameters like Temperature, Humidity, Pressure, Gas Levels & Terrain. These parameters are critical to the design, and comprehensive analysis of these parameters ensures planning and safety of the surface and underground mining activities.","topics":[],"score":2172,"global_rank":224783},{"name":"chaitanyakrishna1248/IoT-based-Tracking-System-for-Emergency-Help","owner":"chaitanyakrishna1248","html_url":"https://github.com/chaitanyakrishna1248/IoT-based-Tracking-System-for-Emergency-Help","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"IoT-based-Tracking-System-for-Emergency-Help","topics":[],"score":2172,"global_rank":224784},{"name":"sys-bio/PluginSystemExample","owner":"sys-bio","html_url":"https://github.com/sys-bio/PluginSystemExample","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"This code gives an example of ho